      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii Yeremyaah uu wada dhammeeyey dadka oo dhan lahadliddiisii uu u sheegayay erayadii Rabbiga Ilaahooda ah oo dhan, ee Rabbiga Ilaahooda ahu uu ugu soo dhiibay, kuwaasoo ah erayadan oo dhan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayaa waxaa hadlay Casaryaah ina Hooshacyaah, iyo Yooxaanaan ina Qaaree'ax, iyo raggii kibirsanaa oo dhan, oo waxay Yeremyaah ku yidhaahdeen, Been baad sheegaysaa. Rabbiga Ilaaheenna ahu kuuma soo dirin inaad tidhaahdid, Masar ha tegina inaad halkaas joogtaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laakiinse Baaruug ina Neeriiyaah ayaa nagu soo kaa diray, si uu gacanta reer Kaldayiin noogu rido inay na laayaan, oo ay maxaabiis ahaan Baabuloon noogu kaxaystaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay Yooxaanaan ina Qaaree'ax, iyo saraakiishii ciidammada oo dhan, iyo dadkii oo dhammuba addeeci waayeen codkii Rabbiga inay dalkii Yahuudah degganaadaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse dadkii Yahuudah ee hadhay oo dhan oo ka soo noqday quruumihii loo kala kaxaystay oo dhan si ay dalkii Yahuudah u degganaadaan waxaa kexeeyey Yooxaanaan ina Qaaree'ax iyo saraakiisha ciidammada oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dadkaasu waxay ahaayeen raggii, iyo naagihii, iyo carruurtii, iyo gabdhihii boqorka, iyo qof kasta oo Nebuusaradaan oo ahaa sirkaalkii waardiyayaashu uu kaga tegey Gedalyaah ina Ahiiqaam oo ahaa ina Shaafaan, iyo Nebi Yeremyaah, iyo Baaruug ina Neeriiyaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay yimaadeen dalkii Masar, waayo, ma ay addeecin codkii Rabbiga, oo waxay yimaadeen ilaa Taxfanxees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaas Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa Yeremyaah ugu yimid Taxfanxees, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhagxan waaweyn gacanta ku qaad, oo iyadoo ay dadka dalka Yahuudah u wada jeedaan waxaad ku dhex qarisaa meesha lebenku yaal ee iridda laga galo guriga Fircoon ee Taxfanxees ku yaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaad iyaga ku tidhaadaa, Rabbiga ciidammada oo ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil wuxuu leeyahay, Bal ogaada, waxaan soo kaxayn doonaa addoonkayga Nebukadresar oo ah boqorka Baabuloon, oo carshigiisaan ka dul qotomin doonaa dhagaxantan aan qariyey, oo isna wuxuu ku dul fidin doonaa taambuuggiisa boqornimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isagu wuu iman doonaa oo wax buu dalka Masar ku dhufan doonaa, oo kuwii dhimasho ku waajibtay dhimashuu siin doonaa, kuwii maxaabiisnimo ku waajibtayna maxaabiis ahaan buu u kaxaysan doonaa, oo kuwii seefu ku waajibtayna seef buu ku layn doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan dab ku dayn doonaa guryaha ilaahyada Masar, oo isna wuu gubi doonaa, oo maxaabiis ahaan buu u kaxaysan doonaa, oo isagu wuxuu dalka Masar u huwan doonaa sida adhijir uu dharkiisa u huwado oo kale, oo halkaasna nabad buu kaga bixi doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba wuxuu wada burburin doonaa tiirarka Beytshemesh oo dalka Masar ku dhex taal, oo guryaha ilaahyada Masarna dab buu ku wada gubi doonaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
